{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703800/extras/Headerart2.jpg?t=1748423367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Into the Fold-Nala Junction is a fast-paced found-footage short horror  in which you fight, shoot, rip, and run for your life- 90s-style.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703800/extras/Gif1_Nala.gif?t=1748423367\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Into the Fold - Nala Junction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You came to document a remote mountain retreat near a quiet, secluded village with a secret no one talks about. It should have been simple: observe, record, and leave.\u00a0Now the night won\u2019t end, and it keeps calling, and they will do anything to keep it a secret.  <br>But the old train near Nala Junction may be your only way out. Catch it before they catch you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Demo is a small part of the full game, highlighting some of the core features, such as atmosphere, combat, enemies, and aesthetics. It consists of a small segment created from  the full game, old caves, and forest path. Other regions are not a focus of this Demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In terms of localization, the Demo has texts and Audio in <i>English</i>. The full game will have 16 supported languages in the interface and subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress made in this demo will not be saved and carried over to the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Full-Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Found-footage style horror</strong>, driven by atmosphere, tension, and isolation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore an abandoned, isolated retreat</strong> tangled in ritual.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect corrupted tapes and documents</strong> to uncover what they  truly want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run and fight</strong>: Use weapons, no stealth, no mercy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Light parkour: </strong>Escape before they catch you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slow-building sense of dread<br>  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703800?t=1748423367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703800/bb53244aa95a546248cd6e146cc764427d0e63ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748423367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703800/ff1aaaa6502a62ffe7fba4d9b10ff984d785d7de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748423367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703800/ff1aaaa6502a62ffe7fba4d9b10ff984d785d7de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748423367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore\r\nViolence\r\nHorror"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703800/extras/Headerart2.jpg?t=1748423367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Into the Fold-Nala Junction is a fast-paced found-footage short horror  in which you fight, shoot, rip, and run for your life- 90s-style.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703800/extras/Gif1_Nala.gif?t=1748423367\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Into the Fold - Nala Junction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You came to document a remote mountain retreat near a quiet, secluded village with a secret no one talks about. It should have been simple: observe, record, and leave.\u00a0Now the night won\u2019t end, and it keeps calling, and they will do anything to keep it a secret.  <br>But the old train near Nala Junction may be your only way out. Catch it before they catch you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Demo is a small part of the full game, highlighting some of the core features, such as atmosphere, combat, enemies, and aesthetics. It consists of a small segment created from  the full game, old caves, and forest path. Other regions are not a focus of this Demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In terms of localization, the Demo has texts and Audio in <i>English</i>. The full game will have 16 supported languages in the interface and subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress made in this demo will not be saved and carried over to the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Full-Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Found-footage style horror</strong>, driven by atmosphere, tension, and isolation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore an abandoned, isolated retreat</strong> tangled in ritual.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect corrupted tapes and documents</strong> to uncover what they  truly want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run and fight</strong>: Use weapons, no stealth, no mercy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Light parkour: </strong>Escape before they catch you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slow-building sense of dread<br>  </p></li></ul>","developers":["Gallic Entertainment"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3639770","name":"Into the Fold - Nala Junction"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703800/2566d89dafd51e5f207ee15e17a0b378241586fe/header.jpg?t=1748423367","is_free":true,"l